</div>
<div class="relative z-10 space-y-2">
<h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white">Community Vetting</h4>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-white/70">Every provider passes our 'Sanctuary Protocol', ensuring zero data tracking and absolute anonymity.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Provider Card 3: Breathwork Alliance -->
<div class="glass-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group">
<div class="space-y-6">
