<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto glass-card rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-stretch">
<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 h-64 md:h-auto">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="A serene, wide-angle cinematic shot of a dark, bioluminescent forest floor. Tiny glowing mushrooms and fern patterns are illuminated by emerald green light from within. Soft mist hangs in the air, creating a deep sense of layered sanctuary and safety. The composition is artistic and minimalist, echoing the glassmorphism UI theme." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAdfbV_TY1Yc6z_zgYKJZT7dup8znsYLrwDOvTtG4Q3-FYpq0D8fPfXcDjJ0Df180bRynjOHxTVO-jGzB0yq1ONAldhwefXVmFsyoIpxWhnPUIfbZcIXq66qdJYGfXD-Qpq-qXMvvDTke5ANVrXdMafF5UDdVLpANlyHSGwC1eMBD-PR9zHwJoESZsOxsXl5SV2J0fB4QAHRXH83n4qJ70GTjP3HlZqmr_nqnx9uCXHTRNDCEiyoGNmTfWTBJryld0rbCybZxApbve2"/>
</div>
<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 p-10 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-4">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">The Sanctuary Oath</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">LumaNation only partners with collectives that uphold our core tenet: Your emotional state is your own property. We never exchange your data for access, ensuring your path remains private and pure.</p>
<div class="pt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">handshake</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Stewardship First</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
